{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "d8a5dde994e64f7b6bd5ff0b379b34689039a7fd9f5d6d1247487d0b78671916", "ja": "離ればなれの気持ち", "zh": "天各一方的心情", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "17f122b17581cc82d51ecf95a8d82572ff9b897dfae765d47779fe49e549c0fc", "ja": "ユニットの練習中、未来と静香の様子が変だ\nと気づいたプロデューサー。翼から事情を聞\nき、未来と話をする。静香に置いていかれな\nいように頑張ると言う未来に、置いていく方\nにも苦しみはある、と語るプロデューサー。", "zh": "在组合练习时，制作人注意到未来和静香的样子有些奇怪\n听翼说明情况后，便和未来交谈。未来说自己会努力，不让静香\n把自己甩在后面。制作人则告诉她，选择把别人甩在后面的人\n也同样会感到痛苦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "be49a40032511e7bd4219fcd454123e92361c1cf29cb019987672ab8d9d87d4d", "ja": "（未来達の今日のレッスンは、3人だけ。未来も静香も\n調子が今ひとつだけど、昨日の特訓が効いてるのかな）", "zh": "（未来她们今天的课程只有3个人。未来和静香的状态都不太好，不过，昨天的特训看来起作用了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "afd241f4d341d0a5c8661a23dec9e2897f39a73fde6c051e94d6ba7139eb7a67", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー、ワン、ツー……。\n……あれ？", "zh": "一、二、三、四，一、二……\n……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9a62df599a43724c00d6a4770f5b8a18954a33f824b73b97147114e744cdfde5", "ja": "ちょっとちょっと、未来！\nどこ行くの～？", "zh": "等等，等等，未来！\n你要去哪儿～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "004b38491b52d37f8159918680d9bfe75e9d9a40f3006917e949e8b6c6cb8f8c", "ja": "未来、そこのステップ、また左右逆になってるぞ。\nこのミス、3回目くらいなんだが……。", "zh": "未来，那个舞步，你又把左右跳反了。\n这个错误都差不多是第3次了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "383e8e6e3b9e91ba54479aa9fc75d38fc384b4a600740ba6d8968d216b49fed0", "ja": "ううっ、ごめんなさ～い！", "zh": "呜呜，对不起～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "858bd1fd3c8ae7cc603c0c314a42041302e5c930b2ab421d426aaf8b1d35b8fc", "ja": "ねえねえ、静香ちゃん。\n未来、どうしちゃったの？", "zh": "喂喂，静香。\n未来这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "3ea365846cafdf5ee3516d76487e9d730ad397781d851a0e2554954b490df80e", "ja": "……知らない。", "zh": "……不知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0789f3b843f2f44e26c8e1458f24b37e925f06b78c6dd64ca48f7eedb0d1315e", "ja": "（未来と静香、今日は様子が変だったな。昨日の\n合同レッスンの後、何かあったのか。後で話を……）", "zh": "（未来和静香今天的状态有点奇怪啊。昨天合练之后，发生什么了吗？待会儿找她们聊聊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1009_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8a350394bbf6eb8d6c7822a5db1c0e46440edceb348acaaa42eeb6855bf98bf1", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いますか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你在吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0160a74fe6bdc26ab78d05b734c7a2db63a43340f0d800cb4a606dfe177b274e", "ja": "あれ、翼？　お疲れさま、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "咦，翼？辛苦了，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7f1a54913bedce563e1aec18c94436d09afabed83920e2c33f470c6c7fa78f29", "ja": "うん……。あのね、静香ちゃんと未来、\n昨日、帰りに何かあったみたいで……。", "zh": "嗯……那个，静香和未来她们，昨天回去的时候好像发生了什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0ae7768194cee37a302cd61301043d4cbfce21d3559b430e6b24da4570f5e621", "ja": "その事か……\n何かって、ケンカでもしたのか？", "zh": "是那件事啊……\n你说的是什么事，难道吵架了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ef099cf79bd49aefc27174c9165927c1008aac3bce712d20d6f058c92b9bfb0a", "ja": "んー。ケンカとは、ちょっと違うのかも？　ふたりとも\n言いたくないみたいで教えてくれなかったんですけど。", "zh": "嗯——可能和吵架有点不一样？她们两个好像都不想说，所以没告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "aa2fa3e73c4a45224b4fee11f925ca051e7196542858a20f85313402f153d607", "ja": "未来、今日ずっと元気がないんです。\n静香ちゃんも何だかピリピリしてる感じだし。", "zh": "未来今天一直都没什么精神。\n静香好像也莫名有些烦躁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "252df5516dfe8ae41652b13ff9461f9a8d8a3ba0889efaff935a006d799a5b4c", "ja": "そうだったのか……わかった、話を聞いてみるよ。\n教えてくれてありがとうな、翼。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……我知道了，我去听听她们怎么说。\n谢谢你告诉我，翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c489736d335b77fc9c983a3269331b3a4172f39902d9099163495435583baaf0", "ja": "どういたしまして♪　……せっかく3人でユニットが\n組めたのに、ヘンな感じなの、イヤだったから。", "zh": "不客气♪……好不容易能由3人组成组合，我不喜欢那种奇怪的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "36219325351c11928ddb77a269e5553e1b56438f55042fa5a4e213db3c76369d", "ja": "うん……そうだよな。わかるよ。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。我明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0c0196c6c13284ca8182a7baaebb41d61e689d6e2f9a09589e73328af7294fec", "ja": "わたし、みんなのことちゃんと見てるでしょ？\nだから{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "我一直都有好好关注大家，对吧？所以，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0405db5de648adc2ceb7c59c56ac5345a694dd91f98e1e1ba2c1e1cbb8422bb4", "ja": "わたしのこと、センターにしてもいいんですよ♪", "zh": "让人家当C位也可以哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e71bbee6960e302d95a6f37b80e11f0f71337cb8754022fac68834188b4c7f8e", "ja": "え！？", "zh": "诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "411fc19cf535facc1b38c4b5074d6791adf17046574ef88e1f7ca799a6221a1e", "ja": "センターとかリーダーは、周りのことをよく見てなきゃ\nダメなんだよね？　わたし、ちゃんと見てますよ～♪", "zh": "站C位也好，做队长也好，都得好好观察周围的情况才行，对吧？我一直都有认真观察哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "21f30482f4f92792b72a4baca476e6f0a6d5325cb56773546173e137a2cbccc1", "ja": "そうか……うん、そうだな。\n翼は案外、リーダーに向いてるかもしれないな。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，说得也是。\n翼说不定还挺适合当队长的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7e9ab18ed6317cc8975cfc2d5d65d2b0b71e167fafbff783d604377426e372bb", "ja": "ホント！？　リーダーに向いてるって、\n言われたことないから、すっごくうれしいかも～。", "zh": "真的！？因为从来没人说过我适合当队长，所以我特别开心～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6c0ab6d4c2d3d0fc988f20f0dee532670e90a5489e25701cf7684237ac4a4c9f", "ja": "じゃあわたし、もう帰りますね。\n{$P$}さん、また明日♪", "zh": "那我就先回去了。\n{$P$}先生，明天见♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "631a3f3e4a771f36f26fb1775d6e12b6d99836d95c342a4d356297403b9408d8", "ja": "ああ、また明日！　気をつけて帰れよ、翼！", "zh": "啊，明天见！回去路上小心，翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e1eb19d5b326530bce2076304186937525a34d71d3e7c2e77efd419b208eb87a", "ja": "は～いっ！", "zh": "好～的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1028_p", "source_sha256": "5073ef1ed03a3909f317aebedbd59d033abe4142a343d5cd6a7ec180aab52ca2", "ja": "（ちゃっかりしているのは相変わらずだけど、\n何気ない言葉からも、翼の成長を感じるな）", "zh": "（还是一如既往地会占便宜，不过从不经意的话语中，也能感受到翼的成长啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "153dcbb0b629c5e15f02a7891fbc565d2c5e278786a46ac8cd1c0ee7e0b2a1f1", "ja": "（後は、未来と静香か……まだ劇場に残ってるかな）", "zh": "（接下来就是未来和静香了……不知道她们还在不在剧场）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "a4551a4f05084ff5c5e324dbf4f23b331f439a48190e1dea07c8a383f625ef06", "ja": "あ、未来！\nレッスンもう終わったの？　お疲れさま！", "zh": "啊，未来！\n练习已经结束了吗？辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "800e5ca7027bc0d7bce6fe87605095cf01ce76ecaf4c5294ecea9354b2bcdd30", "ja": "あ……百合子、杏奈……。", "zh": "啊……百合子、杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "005d6eeee2746f94872b4d4413f0fdbc40dad3d7b886a6a6c4b0dde4c126d120", "ja": "……？　未来……なんか、元気ない……？", "zh": "……？未来……好像、没什么精神……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "2984938da835a181649c4c8aeb104bd7c1932d15c97fed5f09d092bbb2cb19f6", "ja": "あ……。えへへ。\nちょっとね……。", "zh": "啊……嘿嘿。\n只是有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "5b5b1685ebf4eaeaa7c8949ff608d27ba2b96a9be3188d86afc349db43ff4a04", "ja": "目指すものが違う、いつかは別れなきゃいけない、か。\nけっこう厳しいこと言われちゃったね……。", "zh": "目标不同，总有一天必须分别，是吗？\n还真被说了些挺严厉的话呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1035_024ann", "source_sha256": "e2737cc70f93cb079444294bba7d0fe47d3e70054edbc6a879fd4d4e6dee173b", "ja": "それで……悩んでたの……。", "zh": "所以……我才一直烦恼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "e597afeec7aa2d17806958986e9571aa33f80c304b40dfb1c1bbd2672c025e1a", "ja": "うん。……私、みんなとアイドルやるの楽しくて、\nずっと今のままでいたいって思ってたけど……。", "zh": "嗯……和大家一起当偶像真的很开心，我一直都希望能保持现在这样，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "eabd0b8913d3154ccb54401299a6982c26d404ebf6873c087bd2e1f19aa5a79a", "ja": "今のままでいたら、静香ちゃんとは、\nいつかいっしょにいられなくなるのかなって……。", "zh": "如果一直这样下去，我迟早会没法和静香一起了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "37021dd92d38d5ceb6732636106d060e0e37249e8ac8bd04d353077b4be44a72", "ja": "昨日も、いっしょに帰ってたのに……\nと、途中で、置いていかれちゃったし……ぐすっ。", "zh": "昨天，明明还一起回家的……\n结果，走到一半就被丢下了……呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1039_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "1983848558eafaa1b0067cd7cdb2e5d3378bb8c8aceb629bb9834adf03e0ffea", "ja": "良かった、未来まだいたんだな。\n百合子と杏奈も、お疲れさま……？", "zh": "太好了，未来你还在这里啊。百合子和杏奈，也辛苦了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "eae8963d163f3900baab139647fe66bce532530d375096f8423ccb2d054e5a25", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん。\n……ぐすっ。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生。\n……呜咽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "2e7f9448084ec3c7dae8b8c34ff5cb0d039cf819feb856ae376420927c4d1d8b", "ja": "だ、だめっ！\n{$P$}さん、見ないでっ！", "zh": "不、不行！\n{$P$}先生，别看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "8f1e4081968d38e350cec545bf4a86574ceba408361f57d27fae7256f589572f", "ja": "え？　……未来、どうしたんだ！？", "zh": "咦？……未来，你怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1044_024ann", "source_sha256": "04fdf1820015b2462a5bcaf10af60ea9a353c404181631508ba25593958478c8", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nタイミング、悪すぎ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n时机也太差了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "7bec020818e180fddc53fec48cc202325f336339a4fdd09a346b58b037557514", "ja": "そうか……静香と、そんな話をしたのか……。", "zh": "这样啊……原来你和静香聊了那种事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1046_014mir", "source_sha256": "fe2902b58c979c702ee69edd1eee22b9a0511656e8c477e1412424f0a1718964", "ja": "えへへ……心配かけてごめんなさい。\nそこまで落ち込んでるわけじゃないんですけど。", "zh": "嘿嘿……让你担心了，对不起。\n我也没有消沉到那种程度啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1047_014mir", "source_sha256": "9b7730ce02c1c44ec87d3807fce28f644c736c39681ad8acad4dde81146c2053", "ja": "私は、グランプリを取れなくても別にいいんですけど。\n静香ちゃんとお別れするのは、いやだなぁ……。", "zh": "就算没拿到冠军我也无所谓。可是，我不想和静香分开啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1048_014mir", "source_sha256": "3855be0ba1ef294630c4ba025ee3d8768f50415667bd3f4011a00924f4c5fe5d", "ja": "でもこんなこと言ってるから、\n静香ちゃんは私に愛想を尽かしちゃったのかも。", "zh": "可是我一直说这种话，说不定静香已经对我厌烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1049_026yur", "source_sha256": "39c8c780041482bdd67033efc196381db4c2821058f7c988253136b6eb901d7d", "ja": "私は、未来の気持ちもわかるなぁ。誰もが\n上を目指してるって、言葉では簡単に言えるけど……。", "zh": "我也能理解未来的心情呢。说大家都在向更高处努力，嘴上说起来很简单，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1050_026yur", "source_sha256": "be3fee8e079e3677478127aa0874f7143ef364dff60bab94ae9c6a76f1f19f0f", "ja": "でも、いきなり世界デビューなんて決まったら……\n怖くて、足がすくんじゃうかもって思うし。", "zh": "不过，要是突然决定去世界出道……\n我觉得我可能会害怕得双腿发软。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1051_024ann", "source_sha256": "b5088da4f86e03cb1999efeccdcaadc68fd59cbb4583f8aa025b6fe8e25882c5", "ja": "……杏奈も、大きな舞台は……\nまだちょっと、怖い……。", "zh": "……杏奈也觉得，大舞台……\n还是会有点，害怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1052_026yur", "source_sha256": "47dbf987a02b4084527a2a0ffa9cb39e12d2609ebead76635522009d229735e7", "ja": "あ！　でも、未来が静香ちゃんと離れたくないって\nいうのは、がんばる理由になるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "啊！不过，未来不想和静香分开\n这件事，不也能成为努力的理由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1053_026yur", "source_sha256": "4dcd65a3dc4d59f6f5c6bc129410db74b2c3ff449515b327e4601ec2dfa66f2f", "ja": "そのために練習して、静香ちゃんについていく……じゃ\nダメなんですか？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "为了这个去练习，然后跟上静香……不行吗？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1054_024ann", "source_sha256": "89fdc0238fa7d5fbfe39376def7211f571d090f09e1dd00f2924f2bc8c357425", "ja": "なんか……動機が不純、かも……。", "zh": "总觉得……动机可能不太纯粹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1055_p", "source_sha256": "aecd302de61f42097094025cdf2012dea0e842ba4e3395baba275945451a1528", "ja": "そうだな。仲間に置いていかれたくない……\nそれも理由のひとつではあると思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。我也不想被伙伴们落下……\n我觉得这也是其中一个理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1056_014mir", "source_sha256": "ec8223e94cc18eca3bb72b333291b8475f625ce0e5e7b60df64e49900f72cf32", "ja": "そっか……わかりました！　私、静香ちゃんに\n見捨てられないように、がんばって練習する！", "zh": "这样啊……我明白了！为了不被静香抛下，我会努力练习的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1057_p", "source_sha256": "8f554a4377996505c3e0e01c8738d8137b321e9e863b127819e080f68f82fbc4", "ja": "ただし、これだけは覚えておいてくれ。未来が、仲間と\n一緒にアイドルをやりたいから頑張るとして……。", "zh": "不过，有一件事你一定要记住。未来是因为想和伙伴们一起当偶像，才努力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1058_p", "source_sha256": "89e0b5babcad32e491de705270d4460a83bc19a0b0a2430ca066e453242eb286", "ja": "いつか、その仲間と競わなきゃいけない日も来る。\n……その時、未来は置いていかれるかもしれない。", "zh": "总有一天，必须和那些伙伴竞争的日子也会到来。\n……到了那时，未来你也许会被抛在后面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1059_014mir", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1060_p", "source_sha256": "810ae878e529f9990799329196f6a4b59ab668f4841b282cecf8df229d96ad5c", "ja": "けど、置いていく方にも覚悟は必要だし苦しみもある。\nその事は、理解しておいて欲しい。", "zh": "但是，选择留下对方的人也需要做好觉悟，同样会感到痛苦。\n希望你能理解这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1061_014mir", "source_sha256": "34f261c8b87073ed0e8992f3a94cf3873289f4549b76501b498e740b7e3fb951", "ja": "置いていくほうの覚悟と……苦しみ……。\n……。", "zh": "舍下他人的一方所需的觉悟和……痛苦……\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_03_1062_p", "source_sha256": "65510c38ef4a30603445fe61a486b358804c967f23cc8f70a346dc84001ca2d5", "ja": "（未来は未来なりに、考えようとしている。\n静香とも、話をしないとな……）", "zh": "（未来也在用自己的方式努力思考。也得和静香谈谈才行啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
